# Native worktrees created by the harness
/.claude/worktrees

# Supplier product photography — the originals WalletImagesSeeder reads from.
# ~60MB and growing, and git would carry every version of every shot forever.
# What the site actually serves is the normalized output the seeder writes to
# storage/app/public/card-holders. Keep this folder backed up outside git; a
# fresh clone needs it restored before `db:seed --class=WalletImagesSeeder`.
/walletImages

# Filament's published vendor assets (plain file copy from vendor/, regenerated by filament:assets)
/public/css/filament
/public/js/filament
/public/fonts/filament
